                                                                                     href="https://support.backupsheep.com/docs/backup-schedule-types">learn more</a> </label>
                                  <p class="text-sm leading-5 text-gray-500">Both rate-based and cron-based schedules are recurring schedules. <!-- A one-time schedule is a schedule that invokes a target only once.--></p>
                                  <fieldset class="mt-4">
